{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":5,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":185,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1898547,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":272117,"Name":"britxoxo","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272117.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1434315143,"LastPoster":{"Id":283167,"Name":"yycbride2016","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283167.jpg?_r=1432133572","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":34,"Preview":{"Id":1898547,"PostDate":1434315143,"PostContent":"I'm having a hard time wording my accommodation cards for the invites.. our resort requires us to...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"britneyscanlon@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"76.102.65.125","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1375310104,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272117.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"britxoxo","Id":272117,"Name":"britxoxo","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"162.119.128.105","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79275,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by britxoxo, 14 June 2015 - 12:53 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1434315185,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"31a6f980b420043e20d4346a11ffae3b","RawContent":"I&#039;m having a hard time wording my accommodation cards for the invites.. our resort requires us to all book through one person through destination weddings.. having a hard time figuring out how to state that! Thank you all in advance and please share yours if possible !! Thank you :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1898547,"PostDate":1434315143,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm having a hard time wording my accommodation cards for the invites.. our resort requires us to all book through one person through destination weddings.. having a hard time figuring out how to state that! Thank you all in advance and please share yours if possible !! Thank you <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"britneyscanlon@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"76.102.65.125","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1375310104,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272117.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"britxoxo","Id":272117,"Name":"britxoxo","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.15.187","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79275,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"163270f819d5f332b1439e3a05797d2c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I&#039;ve never heard of an \"accommodation card\" before. Maybe one of the other ladies here can chime in with info that will help you out. Congrats!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1898549,"PostDate":1434317929,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I've never heard of an \"accommodation card\" before. Maybe one of the other ladies here can chime in with info that will help you out. Congrats!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283458999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.146.146.173","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79275,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7312672354e9947a6ae1676dead166ee","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I also have never heard of an accommodation card, unless this is just an additional card you will have with &amp;nbsp;your invites that speaks on the accommodations\/resort, etc.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My invites were fairly basic and just directed our guests to our wedding website that I made for FREE on mywedding.com&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;There I had a page just for booking. &amp;nbsp;I had all the prices listed, what you got for that price, connectors to\/from major gateways, dates, flight times, deadlines, etc.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Our guests had the option not to book with us though and I made it clear what the cost was if they didn&#039;t stay at our resort. &amp;nbsp;Most booked with us - our travel agent info was supplied - and some booked alone.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;That said, if your guests MUST book one specific way, then I think it is ok to be frank with the details. &amp;nbsp;It seems people make their own rules and have their own ideas about weddings, especially DW, so I think just short, sweet, and to the point is best.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Show us what you have and maybe we can help tweak it, good luck!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1898554,"PostDate":1434321690,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I also have never heard of an accommodation card, unless this is just an additional card you will have with \u00a0your invites that speaks on the accommodations\/resort, etc.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My invites were fairly basic and just directed our guests to our wedding website that I made for FREE on mywedding.com<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>There I had a page just for booking. \u00a0I had all the prices listed, what you got for that price, connectors to\/from major gateways, dates, flight times, deadlines, etc.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Our guests had the option not to book with us though and I made it clear what the cost was if they didn't stay at our resort. \u00a0Most booked with us - our travel agent info was supplied - and some booked alone.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>That said, if your guests MUST book one specific way, then I think it is ok to be frank with the details. \u00a0It seems people make their own rules and have their own ideas about weddings, especially DW, so I think just short, sweet, and to the point is best.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Show us what you have and maybe we can help tweak it, good luck!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399428602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"76.102.65.125","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79275,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b959b62d57cf3774c23d4521a7655b06","RawContent":"I&#039;m using pocket style invites so the accommodation card staying inside the invite... some brides do a RSVP, reservation and accommodation card.. I was just hoping to do one, and put the rest of our info up online on our website..","Attachments":[],"Id":1898557,"PostDate":1434325223,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm using pocket style invites so the accommodation card staying inside the invite... some brides do a RSVP, reservation and accommodation card.. I was just hoping to do one, and put the rest of our info up online on our website.. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"britneyscanlon@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"76.102.65.125","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1375310104,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272117.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"britxoxo","Id":272117,"Name":"britxoxo","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"162.157.216.37","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79275,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by yycbride2016, 15 June 2015 - 06:38 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1434422301,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d0babaa0928c29fa4ac6ba08c6657c59","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"britxoxo\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I also did pocket invitations. Check out my planning thread to see my different cards. I had an Resort card (accommodations), RSVP to DW, Reception at home info, and an RSVP to the AHR. On my \"accommodations\" card I had the resort name, departure date\/ city (as we have 2 locations of departure), my TA contact information, and website to register for the group rate.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81317]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81318]&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1898641,"PostDate":1434422239,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"272117\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/272117-britxoxo\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">britxoxo<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>I also did pocket invitations. Check out my planning thread to see my different cards. I had an Resort card (accommodations), RSVP to DW, Reception at home info, and an RSVP to the AHR. On my \"accommodations\" card I had the resort name, departure date\/ city (as we have 2 locations of departure), my TA contact information, and website to register for the group rate.\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/81317-invitation1\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18038\/sml_gallery_283167_18038_23931.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Invitation1'  width='200' height='150'  alt='Invitation1' id='sml_image_view_81317' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/81318-invitation-2\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18038\/sml_gallery_283167_18038_53278.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Invitation 2'  width='200' height='150'  alt='Invitation 2' id='sml_image_view_81318' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>~*~YYCBRIDE2016~*~<\/p><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79227-yycbride2016-grand-sirenis-planning-thread-february-2016\/'>My planning thread\u00a0<\/a><\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p><p><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><br><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10730;484\/st\/20160223\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-1\/k\/4bd8\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><br><\/a><br>\u00a0","Email":"janellepaquin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"162.157.216.37","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1432101304,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283167.jpg?_r=1432133572","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"yycbride2016","Id":283167,"Name":"yycbride2016","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79275","Title":"Accommodation Card Info!","LastPostDate":1434422239},"Pages":{"TotalItems":5,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":4,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
